\end{align*}
$$

## Varianza compartida

::: {.fragment}
$$SS_{tot}=SS_{reg} + SS_{error}$$
:::

::: {.fragment}
$$\frac{SS_{tot}}{SS_{tot}}=\frac{SS_{reg}}{SS_{tot}} + \frac{SS_{error}}{SS_{tot}}$$
:::

::: {.fragment}
$$1=\frac{SS_{reg}}{SS_{tot}}+\frac{SS_{error}}{SS_{tot}}$$
:::

::: {.fragment}
$$\frac{SS_{reg}}{SS_{tot}}= 1- \frac{SS_{error}}{SS_{tot}}=R^2$$
:::


